{"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm looking for the step definition behind \"i_click_on_in_the\" and \"i_click_on\", probably in behat_general. There's also an \"element not interactable\" error, which I suspect comes from the header search toggle, since I'm recalling how that control is built in recent Moodle versions.\n\nI'm still trying to pin down the Moodle header search toggle, which in recent versions may be a button wired through `i_click_on`, but I can't confirm that without the DOM. The \"element not interactable\" error probably means the performsearch button is hidden until the toggle opens the search box. I'd need to check the language strings for the toggle and submit labels before going further.\n\nI'm going to read chunks of behat_general in parallel, checking around the i_click_on_in_the step, since the form field setup in behat_forms could be the source of the non-interactable error too.\n\n","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01Mv9NP633bf8rfx4a5a7x7w","name":"mcp__study_moodle_repair_read","arguments":{"i":"Locating click_on step implementations","path":"public/lib/tests/behat/behat_general.php","start":1,"end":300},"intent":"Locating click_on step implementations"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01T1xQ62Jo28qVu4ErDjfyru","name":"mcp__study_moodle_repair_read","arguments":{"i":"Reading click_on step implementations region","path":"public/lib/tests/behat/behat_general.php","start":300,"end":600},"intent":"Reading click_on step implementations region"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-5-5","usage":{"input":2,"output":1068,"cacheRead":15271,"cacheWrite":2487,"totalTokens":18828,"cost":{"input":2.0000000000000002e-7,"output":0.000534,"cacheRead":0.00015271,"cacheWrite":0.000310875,"total":0.000997785},"cttl":{"ephemeral5m":2487}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1794801363734,"requestControls":{"messageIndex":9,"tools":{"declared":[